d agency reviews, the Milestone Dates will be modified accordingly."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"The start of pre-design is 30 days after the submittal of the Remedial Measures Report, and must occur prior to EPA/EPD agreement on the preferred option.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":369.342,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":90.0,"r":542.5412000000017,"t":389.895},"charspan":[0,154],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/2","text":"The start of pre-design is 30 days after the submittal of the Remedial Measures Report, and must occur prior to EPA/EPD agreement on the preferred option."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"See Table 4-12 for a description of typical deliverables.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":348.342,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":90.0,"r":318.252,"t":358.395},"charspan":[0,57],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/3","text":"See Table 4-12 for a description of typical deliverables."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"The activity schedules (Appendix D) present intermediate activities to be used to monitor that satisfactory progress is being made to achieve the milestones.  The Construction contractor will develop a detailed activity schedule that will be substituted for the presumed construction activity schedule.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":306.342,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":90.0,"r":539.5493999999997,"t":338.145},"charspan":[0,302],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/4","text":"The activity schedules (Appendix D) present intermediate activities to be used to monitor that satisfactory progress is being made to achieve the milestones.  The Construction contractor will develop a detailed activity schedule that will be substituted for the presumed construction activity schedule."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"furniture","label":"page_footer","orig":"C:\\DOCUMENTS AND SETTINGS\\CCOATES\\DESKTOP\\MAUWI\\VOLUME_1\\SECT_